    "scope": "Root actually viewed every native source, nearest4 pixels, full returned PNG and white/cyan/alpha sheet. Ordered builtin bindings verified by runtime/root-review-slot-b/rollingb275/verified-binding.json SHA256 7826439221ef41f1a1b4ce147394859a7b228d8f607303bf340eb4fc8a59e558. Mascot reference 766ae05fcdab3bd41f9f0967e64f387de3adafef0f29626570d5670d9b460976 actually viewed earlier in this root execution; reuse the exact unchanged byte-verified visual observation. Started 2026-10-28T22:37:59.688Z completed 2026-10-28T22:41:32.657Z. Actual raw numeric stats [{\"index\":1,\"size\":[1274,1235],\"alpha_extrema\":[0,255],\"alpha_counts_252_255\":{\"252\":198921,\"253\":798252,\"254\":2884,\"255\":770}},{\"index\":2,\"size\":[1269,1239],\"alpha_extrema\":[0,255],\"alpha_counts_252_255\":{\"252\":208956,\"253\":718447,\"254\":3022,\"255\":871}},{\"index\":3,\"size\":[1081,1455],\"alpha_extrema\":[255,255],\"alpha_counts_252_255\":{\"252\":0,\"253\":0,\"254\":0,\"255\":1572855}},{\"index\":4,\"size\":[1081,1455],\"alpha_extrema\":[255,255],\"alpha_counts_252_255\":{\"252\":0,\"253\":0,\"254\":0,\"255\":1572855}}]. Visible-alpha-v1 applied only after visual inspection of backing/body/hair/cloth/frame/note and collar fit. Simple shaded mouth edge also exists on mascot reference; it is not independently a fleshy human lip defect. Tiny unreadable source detail explicitly limited, never claimed proven.  No game-display validation.",
    "approved": {
      "1": "Framed card retains tilted worn frame and full opaque grey photo backing with cream overlapping note, dark peaked cap with gold front insignia/braid, greying side hair/brows and moustache, dark uniform with red/gold collar tabs. Stern simple mascot mouth, round yellow head/green-black eyes, compact collar contact; no visible alpha holes. Exact tiny original badge/hat ornament and individual moustache hairs unresolved, no readable-note claim.",
      "2": "Framed card preserves dark olive peaked cap/gold circular front insignia/band, dark side hair/brows and small moustache, stern mascot mouth, dark high-collar military uniform with red/gold tabs. Round yellow head meets broad short closed collar, no nose/ear or human lip rolls. Complete tilted frame/opaque photo and cream note show no visible punched holes on white/cyan/alpha; interior252–254 alone allowed. Original fine moustache/hat-emblem and note glyph microdetails limited.",
      "3": "Human fleshy lip rolls corrected into a simple dark mascot opening. Retains brown swept wavy hair, sideburn contour, dark round spectacles, faint neck/jaw stipple, grey blue suit, pale shirt/dark tie, rightward three-quarter pose and dark grey backdrop. No independent human nose or ear/pinna; compact broad contact at collar, no separate narrow throat stalk. Lens highlights are reflections, not human white sclera. Source fine individual facial-hair stipple unresolved.",
      "4": "Prior independent nose corrected; smooth yellow mascot face behind actual fine round glasses, green-black eyes and single simple mouth beneath curled moustache. Retains dark brushed hair/brows, long curled moustache and clean chin, olive brown suit, white shirt/dark tie, three-quarter head and grey backdrop. Compact broad collar contact, no human ear/pinna or white sclera on face. Background seen through far extended lens is outside face, not eye anatomy. Fine original tie/hair detail unresolved."
